msgid "Ragdoll system"
msgstr "布娃娃系統"

msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "前言"

msgid ""
"Godot supports ragdoll physics. Ragdolls rely on physics simulation to "
"create realistic procedural animation. They are used for death animations in "
"many games."
msgstr ""
"Godot 支援布娃娃物理。布娃娃依靠物理仿真來建立逼真的程式式動畫，它們被用於許"
"多遊戲中的死亡動畫。"

msgid ""
"In this tutorial, we will be using the Platformer 3D demo to set up a "
"ragdoll."
msgstr "在本教學中，我們將使用 Platformer 3D 演示來進行布娃娃的設定。"

msgid ""
"You can download the Platformer 3D demo on `GitHub <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/3d/platformer>`_ or using the "
"`Asset Library <https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/2748>`_."
msgstr ""
"你可以從 `GitHub <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/"
"master/3d/platformer>`_ 或 `資源庫 <https://godotengine.org/asset-library/"
"asset/2748>`_ 下載 Platformer 3D 範例專案。"

msgid ""
"You can also check out an example of a complete ragdoll setup in the "
"`Ragdoll Physics demo <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/"
"tree/master/3d/ragdoll_physics>`_."
msgstr ""
"你還可以參考 `布娃娃物理演示 <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-"
"projects/tree/master/3d/ragdoll_physics>`_ 中完整的布娃娃系統設定範例。"

msgid "Setting up the ragdoll"
msgstr "設定布娃娃"

msgid "Creating physical bones"
msgstr "建立物理骨骼"

msgid ""
"Like many other features in the engine, there are two nodes which are used "
"to set up a ragdoll:"
msgstr "與引擎中的許多其他功能一樣，設定布娃娃系統也使用了兩個節點："

msgid ""
"A :ref:`PhysicalBoneSimulator3D <class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D>` node. This "
"node is the parent of all physical bones and is responsible for controlling "
"the simulation."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PhysicalBoneSimulator3D <class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D>` 節點。該節點是"
"所有物理骨骼的父節點，負責控制模擬。"

msgid ""
"One or more :ref:`PhysicalBone3D <class_PhysicalBone3D>` children. Each node "
"represents a single bone in the ragdoll."
msgstr ""
"一個或多個 :ref:`PhysicalBone3D <class_PhysicalBone3D>` 子節點。每個節點代表"
"布娃娃模型中的一個骨骼 。"

msgid ""
"Open the platformer demo in Godot, and then the ``player/player.tscn`` "
"scene. Select the ``Skeleton3D`` node. A skeleton button appears at the top "
"of the 3D editor viewport:"
msgstr ""
"在 Godot 中打開 Platformer 演示項目，然後打開 ``player/player.tscn`` 場景。選"
"擇 ``Skeleton3D`` 節點。3D編輯器視埠頂部會顯示一個骨架按鈕："

msgid "Creating a physical skeleton in the editor"
msgstr "在編輯器中建立物理骨架"

msgid ""
"Click it and select the :menu:`Create Physical Skeleton` option. Godot will "
"generate PhysicalBone3D nodes and collision shapes for each bone in the "
"skeleton and pin joints to connect them together:"
msgstr ""
"按一下它並選擇 :menu:`Create Physical Skeleton` 選項。Godot 將為骨架中的每個"
"骨骼生成 PhysicalBone3D 節點和碰撞形狀，並用釘關節將它們連接在一起："

msgid "Scene tree of the player scene after creating a physical skeleton"
msgstr "建立物理骨骼之後玩家場景的場景樹"

msgid ""
"Some of the generated bones aren't necessary, such as the ``MASTER`` bone in "
"this scene. We're going to clean up the skeleton by removing them."
msgstr ""
"一些生成的骨骼不是必需的：例如這個場景中的 ``MASTER`` 骨骼。因此，我們將通過"
"刪除它們來清理骨架。"

msgid "Clean up and optimize the skeleton"
msgstr "清理並最佳化骨骼"

msgid ""
"For each PhysicalBone3D the engine needs to simulate, there is a performance "
"cost. You'll want to remove every bone that is too small to make a "
"difference in the simulation, as well as all utility bones."
msgstr ""
"引擎需要模擬的每一個 PhysicalBone3D 都會消耗一定的效能，因此，你需要移除所有"
"尺寸過小、對模擬影響甚微的骨骼 ，以及所有輔助骨骼。"

msgid ""
"For example, if we take a humanoid, you don't need to have physical bones "
"for each finger. You can use a single bone for the entire hand instead, or "
"one for the palm, one for the thumb, and a last one for the other four "
"fingers."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果我們拿一個人形動物舉例，就不希望每個手指都有物理骨骼。可以用一根骨"
"骼代替整個手，或者用一根骨骼代替手掌，一根骨骼代替拇指，最後一根骨頭代表其他"
"四個手指。"

msgid ""
"Remove these PhysicalBone3D nodes: ``MASTER``, ``waist``, ``neck``, "
"``headtracker``. This gives us an optimized skeleton and makes it easier to "
"control the ragdoll."
msgstr ""
"移除這些 PhysicalBone3D 節點：\\ ``MASTER``\\ 、\\ ``waist``\\ 、\\ "
"``neck``\\ 、\\ ``headtracker``\\ 。這樣就有了一個最佳化的骨架，使其更容易控"
"制布娃娃。"

msgid "Adjust joints and constraints"
msgstr "調整關節和約束"

msgid ""
"Once you adjusted the collision shapes, your ragdoll is almost ready. Now, "
"you need to adjust the pin joints to get a better simulation. PhysicalBone3D "
"nodes have an unconstrained pin joint assigned to them by default. To change "
"the pin joint, select a PhysicalBone3D node and change the constraint type "
"in the :menu:`Joint` section of the inspector. There, you can change the "
"constraint's orientation and its limits."
msgstr ""
"一旦你調整了碰撞形狀，布娃娃就差不多準備好了。現在只需要調整釘關節以獲得更好"
"的模擬效果。PhysicalBone3D 節點在預設情況下有一個不受限制的釘關節。要改變釘關"
"節，請選擇 PhysicalBone3D 節點，然後在屬性檢視器的 :menu:`Joint` 部分改變約束"
"型別。在那裡，你可以改變約束的方向和限制。"

msgid ""
"Joints have a gizmo visible in the 3D editor as well, so you can see their "
"constraints in action."
msgstr "關節在 3D 編輯器中也有可見的小工具 ，因此可以查看其約束的實際效果。"

msgid "Adjusting joints in the inspector after selecting a PhysicalBone3D node"
msgstr "在選擇 PhysicalBone3D 節點後，在屬性檢視器中調整關節"

msgid ""
"To get a better view when editing joints and collision shapes, you can do "
"the following:"
msgstr "為了在編輯關節和碰撞形狀時檢視效果更好，你可以執行以下操作："

msgid ""
"Hide PhysicalBone3D nodes you aren't currently working on, so you can focus "
"on the ones you're adjusting."
msgstr ""
"隱藏目前未在處理的 PhysicalBone3D 節點，以便你可以專注於正在調整的節點。"

msgid ""
"Hide the MeshInstance3D of the character by clicking the eye icon next to it "
"in the scene tree dock."
msgstr ""
"在場景樹面板中 ，點擊角色旁邊的眼睛圖示 ，即可隱藏角色的 MeshInstance3D。"

msgid ""
"Hide the Skeleton3D gizmos, so that the orange triangles that represent the "
"skeleton don't clutter the viewport while leaving the rest visible. To do "
"so, click :menu:`View > Gizmos > Skeleton3D` at the top of the 3D editor "
"viewport until the eye icon appears closed."
msgstr ""
"隱藏 Skeleton3D 小工具 ，這樣代表骨架的橙色三角形就不會佔用視埠空間，同時保持"
"其他小工具可見。為了執行此操作，請按一下 3D 編輯器視埠頂部的 :menu:`View > "
"Gizmos > Skeleton3D` ，直到眼睛圖示合起來。"

msgid ""
"Disable the preview environment by clicking the globe icon at the top of the "
"3D editor viewport."
msgstr "點擊3D編輯器檢視區上方的地球圖標以停用預覽環境。"

msgid ""
"Set the **Default Clear Color** project setting to pure black in the Project "
"Settings. This is only effective if the preview environment is disabled."
msgstr ""
"在專案設定中，將 **預設清屏顏色** 專案設定設為純黑色。此設定僅在停用預覽環境"
"時有效。"

msgid ""
"Change the debug draw mode using the :menu:`Perspective` button in the top-"
"left corner of the 3D editor viewport. The :menu:`Display Wireframe` "
"and :menu:`Display Overdraw` options are particularly useful when adjusting "
"collision shapes, as they allow you to see through the original mesh."
msgstr ""
"使用 3D 編輯器視埠左上角的 :menu:`Perspective` 按鈕以更改除錯繪製模"
"式。:menu:`Display Wireframe` 和 :menu:`Display Overdraw` 選項在調整碰撞形狀"
"時非常好用，它們可以讓你透過原始網格查看內部情況。"

msgid ""
"Use the orthographic camera by clicking "
"the :button:`X`/:button:`Y`/:button:`Z` buttons in the top-right corner of "
"the 3D editor viewport."
msgstr ""
"按一下 3D 編輯器視埠右上角的 :button:`X`/:button:`Y`/:button:`Z` 按鈕，即可使"
"用正交相機 。"

msgid "Here is the list of joints available:"
msgstr "可用的關節清單如下："

msgid "**None:** Does not perform any constraint."
msgstr "**None：** 無，不執行任何約束。"

msgid "**ConeJoint:** Ball-and-socket. Useful for shoulders, hips, neck."
msgstr "**ConeJoint：** 球窩型關節。適用於肩部、髖部、頸部。"

msgid ""
"**HingeJoint:** Provides an angular constraint; think of it like a door "
"hinge. Useful for elbows and knees."
msgstr ""
"**HingeJoint：** 鉸鏈關節。提供角度約束；可以把它想象成門的鉸鏈 。適用於肘部"
"和膝部。"

msgid ""
"**PinJoint:** Keeps two bodies connected *(default)*. Leads to \"crumpling\" "
"of the bones, so it's recommended to use other joint types for most "
"characters instead."
msgstr ""
"**PinJoint：** 銷關節，保持兩個身體連接 *（預設）*\\。它會導致骨骼“變形”，因"
"此建議大多數角色使用其他關節型別。"

msgid "**SliderJoint:** Slides one bone along another on a specific axis."
msgstr "**SliderJoint：** 滑動關節。使一根骨骼沿特定軸線沿另一根骨骼滑動。"

msgid ""
"**6DOFJoint:** Most powerful joint, offering both linear and angular "
"constraints, but also the most complex to configure."
msgstr "**6DOFJoint：** 功能最強大的關節，提供線性和角度約束，但設定也最複雜。"

msgid ""
"If in doubt, start with HingeJoint and ConeJoint, as they cover most use "
"cases:"
msgstr ""
"如有疑問，請先從 HingeJoint 和 ConeJoint 入手，因為它們涵蓋了大多數使用場景："

msgid ""
"For HingeJoint, make sure to enable **Angular Limit** in the :menu:`Joint "
"Constraints` section of the inspector. After enabling it, you can see the "
"angle that it's being constrained to in the viewport. You can rotate the "
"PhysicalBone3D to change the axis where the joint is constrained, then "
"adjust the angles."
msgstr ""
"對於 HingeJoint ，請確保在屬性檢視器的 :menu:`Joint Constraints` 中啟用 **角"
"度限制** 。啟用該選項後，你可以在視埠中看到關節的約束角度。你可以旋轉 "
"PhysicalBone3D 來改變約束關節的軸，然後調整角度。"

msgid ""
"For ConeJoint, it's usually best to limit **Swing Span** between 20 and 90 "
"degrees, and the **Twist Span** between 20 and 45 degrees."
msgstr ""
"對於 ConeJoint ，通常最好將 **擺動範圍** 限制在 20 到 90 度之間，同時將 **扭"
"轉範圍** 限制在 20 到 45 度之間。"

msgid "Adjust collision shapes"
msgstr "調整碰撞形狀"

msgid ""
"The next task is adjusting the collision shape and the size of the physical "
"bones to match the part of the body that each bone should simulate."
msgstr ""
"下一步是調整碰撞形狀和物理骨骼的大小，以匹配每個骨骼應該模擬的身體部位。"

msgid ""
"It's recommended to adjust collision shapes *after* adjusting joints and "
"constraints, as rotating a joint will also rotate the collision shape. To "
"avoid having to adjust collision shapes twice, it's better to adjust joints "
"first."
msgstr ""
"建議在調整關節和約束 *之後* 再調整碰撞形狀，因為旋轉關節也會旋轉碰撞形狀。為"
"了避免重複調整碰撞形狀，最好先調整關節。"

msgid ""
"Note that it's possible to have multiple collision shapes as a child of a "
"PhysicalBone3D node. This can be useful to represent particularly complex "
"shapes of limbs that are otherwise rigid."
msgstr ""
"請注意，PhysicalBone3D 節點可以包含多個碰撞形狀作為子節點。對於原本剛性的肢"
"體，這種方法能夠有效呈現其極其複雜的形態。"

msgid ""
"To pause animation playback while adjusting the ragdoll, select the "
"``AnimationTree`` node and disable the **Active** property in the Inspector. "
"Remember to enable it again when you're done, as it controls animation "
"playback during gameplay."
msgstr ""
"要在調整布娃娃時暫停動畫播放，請選擇 ``AnimationTree`` 節點，然後在檢視面板中"
"停用 **Active** 屬性。完成後記得重新啟用它，因為它控制著遊戲過程中的動畫播"
"放。"

msgid "Adjusting collision shapes in the 3D editor"
msgstr "在 3D 編輯器中調整碰撞形狀"

msgid "This is the final result:"
msgstr "成果應如下圖所示："

msgid ""
"Result after adjusting joints and collision shapes (player mesh is hidden "
"for visibility)"
msgstr "調整關節和碰撞形狀後的結果（為了便於查看，玩家模型已隱藏）"

msgid "Simulate the ragdoll"
msgstr "模擬布娃娃"

msgid ""
"The ragdoll is now ready to use. To start the simulation and play the "
"ragdoll animation, you need to call "
"the :ref:`PhysicalBoneSimulator3D.physical_bones_start_simulation() "
"<class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D_method_physical_bones_start_simulation>` "
"method. Attach a script to the :ref:`PhysicalBoneSimulator3D "
"<class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D>` node that is the parent of all the "
"PhysicalBone3D nodes in our scene, then call it in the script's ``_ready`` "
"method:"
msgstr ""
"現在布娃娃已可以使用了。要開始模擬並播放布娃娃動畫，你需要呼"
"叫 :ref:`PhysicalBoneSimulator3D.physical_bones_start_simulation() "
"<class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D_method_physical_bones_start_simulation>` 方"
"法。將腳本附加到場景中所有的 PhysicalBone3D 節點的父節"
"點 :ref:`PhysicalBoneSimulator3D <class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D>` 上，然後在"
"腳本的 ``_ready`` 方法中呼叫該方法："

msgid ""
"To stop the simulation, call "
"the :ref:`PhysicalBoneSimulator3D.physical_bones_stop_simulation() "
"<class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D_method_physical_bones_stop_simulation>` "
"method."
msgstr ""
"要停止模擬，請呼"
"叫 :ref:`PhysicalBoneSimulator3D.physical_bones_stop_simulation() "
"<class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D_method_physical_bones_stop_simulation>` 方法。"

msgid ""
"You can also limit the simulation to only a few bones. This can be useful to "
"create effects such as ragdoll limbs or attachments that can interact with "
"the world. To do so, pass the bone names (*not* the PhysicalBone3D node "
"names) as a parameter. To see the bone name, look at the **Bone Name** "
"property in the inspector after selecting a PhysicalBone3D node."
msgstr ""
"你還可以將模擬限制為僅包含少數骨骼。對於建立諸如布娃娃肢體或可與世界互動的附"
"件等效果時，這種操作非常有用。為此，請將骨骼名稱（ *而非* PhysicalBone3D 節點"
"的名稱）作為參數傳遞 。要查看骨骼名稱，請在選擇 PhysicalBone3D 節點後，查看屬"
"性檢視器中的 **骨骼名稱** 屬性。"

msgid ""
"When using an automatically generated physical skeleton as shown in this "
"tutorial, the bone name is also contained in the node name. For example, in "
"``Physical Bone l-arm``, ``l-arm`` is the bone name."
msgstr ""
"當使用本教學中所示的自動生成的物理骨骼時， 骨骼名稱也包含在節點名稱中。例如，"
"在 ``Physical Bone l-arm`` 中， ``l-arm`` 就是骨骼名稱。"

msgid ""
"Note that nonexistent bone names will not print any error or warning. If "
"nothing happens when starting the simulation (or if the whole body is "
"ragdolled instead of only specific bones), double-check the list of provided "
"bones."
msgstr ""
"請注意，如果骨骼名稱不存在，則不會輸出任何錯誤或警告。如果在啟動模擬時沒有任"
"何反應（或者整個身體都像布娃娃一樣運動，而不僅僅是特定骨骼），請仔細檢查所提"
"供的骨骼清單。"

msgid "Here's an example of partial ragdoll simulation:"
msgstr "以下是一個區域布娃娃模擬的例子："

msgid ""
"To control how strongly the partial ragdoll simulation affects the overall "
"animation, you can adjust the **Influence** property in "
"the :ref:`PhysicalBoneSimulator3D <class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D>` node that "
"is the parent of all PhysicalBone3D nodes. By default, it's set to ``1.0``, "
"which means the ragdoll simulation fully overrides the rest of the animation."
msgstr ""
"要控制部分布娃娃模擬對整體動畫的影響程度，你可以調整所有 PhysicalBone3D 節點"
"的父節點 :ref:`PhysicalBoneSimulator3D <class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D>` 中的 "
"**Influence** 屬性。預設情況下，該屬性設定為 ``1.0`` ，這意味著布娃娃模擬會完"
"全覆蓋其餘動畫。"

msgid "Collision layer and mask"
msgstr "碰撞層與遮罩"

msgid ""
"Make sure to set up your collision layers and masks properly so the "
"CharacterBody3D's capsule doesn't get in the way of the physics simulation. "
"Remember to adjust the collision layer and mask in the coin scene as well, "
"so that the player can still collect coins:"
msgstr ""
"請務必正確設定碰撞層和遮罩，以免 CharacterBody3D 的膠囊體干擾物理模擬 。同"
"時，也請記得調整金幣場景中的碰撞層和遮罩 ，以便玩家仍然可以收集到金幣。"

msgid ""
"Layers and masks must be adjusted to these values in the inspector for each "
"node"
msgstr "必須在屬性檢視器中將每個節點的圖層和遮罩調整為這些值"

msgid ""
"You can find the GridMap in the 3D platformer demo in ``stage/"
"grid_map.scn``. The coin's Area3D node (on which the layers and masks must "
"be adjusted) can be found at ``coin/coin.tscn``."
msgstr ""
"你可以在 3D 平台遊戲演示的 ``stage/grid_map.scn`` 中找到 GridMap。硬幣的 "
"Area3D 節點（必須調整其圖層和遮罩）位於 ``coin/coin.tscn`` 。"

msgid ""
"To select all PhysicalBone3D nodes quickly, enter ``t:PhysicalBone3D`` in "
"the search bar at the top of the scene tree dock. This filters the scene "
"tree to only show PhysicalBone3D nodes, which allows you to select them all "
"at once using :kbd:`Shift + Left mouse button` on the first and last entries."
msgstr ""
"為了快速選擇所有 PhysicalBone3D 節點，請在場景樹停靠欄頂部的搜尋欄中輸入 "
"``t:PhysicalBone3D`` 。這將會篩選場景樹，使其僅顯示 PhysicalBone3D 節點，這樣"
"你就可以使用 :kbd:`Shift + Left mouse button` 一次性選擇第一個和最後一個節"
"點。"

msgid ""
"If this is not done, collision will behave incorrectly as the player will "
"collide with its own (inactive) ragdoll. This can cause the player to wildly "
"bounce around or get stuck."
msgstr ""
"如果不這樣做，碰撞檢測將出現異常，因為玩家會與自身（非啟用狀態）的布娃娃模型"
"發生碰撞。這可能導致玩家出現劇烈彈跳或卡住。"

msgid ""
"Like RigidBody3D, PhysicalBone3D supports collision exceptions through code "
"using the :ref:`physical_bones_add_collision_exception() "
"<class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D_method_physical_bones_add_collision_exception>` "
"and :ref:`physical_bones_remove_collision_exception() "
"<class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D_method_physical_bones_remove_collision_exception>` "
"methods. This can be used to prevent collisions with a specific object "
"without relying on layers and masks."
msgstr ""
"與 RigidBody3D 類似，PhysicalBone3D 也支援通過程式碼使"
"用 :ref:`physical_bones_add_collision_exception() "
"<class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D_method_physical_bones_add_collision_exception>` "
"和 :ref:`physical_bones_remove_collision_exception() "
"<class_PhysicalBoneSimulator3D_method_physical_bones_remove_collision_exception>` "
